msgctxt "152"
msgid "What's wrong, Haruka? Can't sleep?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I guess there's a lot on my mind. But you don't need\r\n"
"to wait for me, Uncle Kaz. You have a big trip tomorrow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "I actually have some things to do before I hit the hay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "Oh. Well then... can I come with you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "It's past your bedtime, young lady."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid ""
"Awww, you're no fun. Just don't stay up too late! You'll get\r\n"
"all wrinkly and then everyone'll think you're an old man!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid "Funny, people have been calling me that for years..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid ""
"Fair enough. I should probably hit the hay. Don't stay up\r\n"
"too late, all right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "I won't! Sweet dreams, Uncle Kaz."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "Sweet dreams, Haruka."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "Sure, why not?"
msgstr "Certo, perché no?"

msgctxt "296"
msgid "Yippee! Come on, come on, come on!"
msgstr ""

